    {
      "quest_id": "lsh_the_sailmaker",
      "title": "Nobody Has Unfurled Anything",
      "giver_npc_id": "stw_shipwright",
      "zone": "the_lashings",
      "level_min": 46,
      "level_max": 46,
      "description": "The sailmaker on a fleet that does not sail.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "kill_boss",
          "target": "Sailmaker Oona Flay",
          "count": 1,
          "zone": "the_lashings"
        },
        {
          "type": "kill",
          "target": "Hulk Rat",
          "count": 7,
          "zone": "the_lashings"
        }
      ],
      "reward_exp": 4316,
      "reward_gold": 17160,
      "accept_text": "There is a sailmaker on that fleet. I have thought about that more than is healthy.\n\nNobody on those hulls has unfurled a sail in twenty years. So either she has had nothing to do for two decades, or she has been making something else - and I have seen the nets, so I know which.\n\nShe will be on the careenage. That is the hull laid over to have its bottom scraped, and they never righted it, and I think about that one too.",
      "turn_in_text": "Her palm was worn through twice. Twice, on a fleet with no sails.\n\nI have mended canvas for thirty years. I would like it on record that I am sorry about this one in a way I am not sorry about the others.",
      "next_quest_id": null,
