      "turn_in_text": "Ninety-one marks. Most of them crosses.\n\nThat is not a crew list, that is a CENSUS. Ninety-one people with a written agreement about who gets what if they are hurt - which is more than the yard has, and I have been asking for that in writing for three years.\n\nI am going to file this. I am not going to say where under.",
