    {
      "quest_id": "lsh_rake",
      "title": "The One Who Is Good At It",
      "giver_npc_id": "stw_harbourmaster",
      "zone": "the_lashings",
      "level_min": 48,
      "level_max": 48,
      "description": "Captain Ardessa Rake, aboard the only hull in that cove still kept like a ship.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "kill_boss",
          "target": "Captain Ardessa Rake",
          "count": 1,
          "zone": "the_lashings"
        }
      ],
      "reward_exp": 4524,
      "reward_gold": 17940,
      "accept_text": "Ardessa Rake has run that cove for twenty-two years and I want to tell you the thing about her that matters, because it is not that she is cruel.\n\nThere is a Southsea crew up in the Barrens under a man called Saltspray who is loud and bad at it. SHE sent him there. That is what you do with a man who is loud and bad at it when you are good at it and you intend to stay.\n\nShe keeps one hull like a ship. Nine of them and she keeps one. You will know it when you are standing on it.",
      "turn_in_text": "She was on the quarterdeck of a hull that has not moved since before I had this post.\n\nI am going to be straight with you, because the yard will not be: this port will take her cove's trade within a month and call it recovery, and half of what comes down that coast will be the same cargo that went up it.\n\nI still wanted it stopped. Both of those are true and I have stopped trying to make them sit comfortably together.",
      "next_quest_id": "lsh_the_masts_are_gone",
