    {
      "quest_id": "lsh_the_masts_are_gone",
      "title": "You Cannot See Them From the Yard",
      "giver_npc_id": "stw_caravan_agent",
      "zone": "steamwheedle_port",
      "level_min": 48,
      "level_max": 48,
      "description": "What the port does the week after.",
      "objectives": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "topics": [
            "lsh_after"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "explore",
          "target": "steamwheedle_port",
          "target_x": 80,
          "target_y": 54,
          "radius": 8
        }
      ],
      "reward_exp": 3480,
      "reward_gold": 13800,
      "accept_text": "Forty years I have priced freight on this coast and every single price had the Southsea in it. A sixth for the cove, we called it. Nobody wrote it down, it was just in the number.\n\nI have spent this morning repricing everything and I do not mind telling you it has made me feel strange. Go and stand on the Upper Yard and look north and come back.",
      "turn_in_text": "You cannot see the masts. Twenty-two years of being able to see the masts from that yard and you cannot see them.\n\nI will run a cart west now. I have said for three years that there was nothing coming back worth the axle and that was true and it was also a thing I said instead of the real reason.",
